e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −5 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1984","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-chicago-bears","name":"Chicago Bears","code":"CHI","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 156)","str":83.7,"squad":[["Jim McMahon","QB",70],["Mike Tomczak","QB",69],["Walter Payton","RB",96],["Matt Suhey","RB",81],["Willie Gault","WR",88],["Keith Ortego","WR",76],["Dennis Gentry","WR",68],["Ken Margerum","WR",58],["Emery Moorehead","TE",81],["Tim Wrightman","TE",61],["Jay Hilgenberg","OL",82],["Jim Covert","OL",82],["Keith Van Horne","OL",82],["Tom Thayer","OL",82],["Mark Bortz","OL",76],["Kurt Becker","OL",56],["Larry Rubens","OL",53],["Dan Hampton","DL",91],["Steve McMichael","DL",86],["Richard Dent","DL",85],["William Perry","DL",80],["Mike Hartenstine","DL",65],["Henry Waechter","DL",60],["Wilber Marshall","LB",99],["Otis Wilson","LB",94],["Mike Singletary","LB",78],["Mike Richardson","CB",92],["Vestee Jackson","CB",71],["Reggie Phillips","CB",70],["Maurice Douglass","CB",53],["Dave Duerson","S",98],["Gary Fencik","S",88],["Shaun Gayle","S",57],["Kevin Butler","K",88]]},{"id":"nfl-new-york-giants","name":"New York Giants","code":"NYG","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 301)","str":83.7,"squad":[["Phil Simms","QB",84],["Jeff Rutledge","QB",55],["Joe Morris","RB",96],["Maurice Carthon","RB",79],["Bobby Johnson","WR",78],["Stacy Robinson","WR",76],["Lionel Manuel","WR",68],["Solomon Miller","WR",67],["Mark Bavaro","T